{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dead Exhale Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is a 20-30 minute section of the beginning of the game, designed to give you a feel for the full experience. Evade the monster, collect and increase your character's power. Uncover the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.poster.avif?t=1753820766\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.webm?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.mp4?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Horror Factor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead Exhale has been developed from the ground up with one of the most advanced monster A.I.'s ever made. Specifically designed to not only hunt the player but toy with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.poster.avif?t=1753820766\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.webm?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.mp4?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzles and Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With everything you discover you'll have environmental story telling. No notes to slow you down, only real voice actors and thousands of years of lore written into a single experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.poster.avif?t=1753820766\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.webm?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.mp4?t=1753820766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Perfectly Designed For Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Especially catered and created to utilize retention for videos and streams, this is the next evolution of horror games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839040?t=1753820766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/3708929f90e0c663ac6e576d209d9df113afdd50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753820766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/634ddd329ca9670d8f4ae15d9935fe2e3b565e56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753820766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839040/634ddd329ca9670d8f4ae15d9935fe2e3b565e56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753820766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dead Exhale Demo</h2><p class=\